# Commands run by the launchd job com.redwood.demo (see com.redwood.demo.plist).
/redwood/bin/hello_dyn started by launchd
# --- the Files app, with nobody at the phone (test only, 60 s; the kernel with var_apfs=1): the lock screen swiped
# away, Files opened by its URL scheme, its Browse tab (the list of locations), and "On My iPhone" opened ---
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 15 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 4
/var/jb/usr/bin/uiopen shareddocuments://
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 8 tap 0.83 0.93 wait 3 tap 0.83 0.93 wait 4 tap 0.35 0.375 wait 6
